{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12225540","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12225540","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1222554001:0":{"text":"Lucca, you actually came in person!","source_cn":"卢卡，你竟然亲自来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9D200109EA772D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222554002:1":{"text":"Do the Whispers have any leads on the Hyposhark?","source_cn":"血薇帮查到鲨鱼恶魔的线索了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9AE6C1541B044B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222554003:0":{"text":"Yes, we found something.","source_cn":"查到了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB6266A490CCC556","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222554004:0":{"text":"According to a few ancient tomes we found in the upper district, a primordial Hypogean named <style=\"highlight\">Harak</style> was sealed beneath the Blackthorn Sea.","source_cn":"上城区大图书馆古籍里的记载：古时名为<style=hi...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01A1D50C5B9DDEF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222554005:0":{"text":"We even discovered a phrase written by the author near Harak's name.","source_cn":"除此之外，卷宗上还有其他内容。我们发现撰书人在哈拉克的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF926F78ABC671FB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222554006:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">Desires and instincts</style>.","source_cn":"——<style=highlight>欲望与本能</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D4DE45CAE228FF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1222554006":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">Desires and instincts</style>.","source_cn":"——<style=highlight>欲望与本能</style>。”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D4DE45CAE228FF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1222554007:0":{"text":"Could it be that his instincts are so powerful that they overrule his reasoning?","source_cn":"难道说，他的本能过于强大，以至于压倒了理性？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE70F0E5941713E01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222554008:1":{"text":"He surrendered his ability to communicate and think, leaving only the most primal, beast-like urge to devour... that's why he's so strong!","source_cn":"牺牲了交流和思考的能力，只留下最原始最兽性的进食冲动…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x106FCB6896CC8901","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222554009:0":{"text":"In other words, he's not the brightest, is he?","source_cn":"换个说法，也就是他脑子不太聪明？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A710CB576FB719E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1222554010:0":{"text":"Seems pretty dumb to Chippy!","source_cn":"感觉相当不聪明！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA03DC2639B09D53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1222554010":{"text":"Seems pretty dumb to Chippy!","source_cn":"感觉相当不聪明！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA03DC2639B09D53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1222554011:1":{"text":"Thanks, Lucca! Tell Sonja we're in her debt.","source_cn":"谢了，卢卡！回索尼娅一声，我们欠她个人情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E1B015D6C22A73D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1222554012:1":{"text":"I got it.","source_cn":"嗯。<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26D789450430CD33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1222554013:0":{"text":"One more thing, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>. I have a message from Sonja.","source_cn":"还有一件事。<style=stress><player...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8AB7F6E29BF1B46A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"One more thing, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>. I have a message from Sonja.","female":"One more thing, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>. I have a message from Sonja.","variant_male_record_index":"138533","variant_female_record_index":"138534","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1222554014:0":{"text":"She's confident you'll win, no matter who it is you're up against.","source_cn":"她相信无论对手是谁，你会赢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6F9B422B307FF7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:24:1222554014":{"text":"She's confident you'll win, no matter who it is you're up against.","source_cn":"她相信无论对手是谁，你会赢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6F9B422B307FF7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:25:1222554015:0":{"text":"Lucca nodded and left.","source_cn":"卢卡点点头，离开了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE31F3B4C2AD47C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1222554016:0":{"text":"Alright, let's go find Tasi.","source_cn":"好，我们去找塔西吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3211845F1FD8CC77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1222554017:1":{"text":"Sinbad, have you thought of a plan to deal with Harak?","source_cn":"辛巴达，你想出应对哈拉克的计策了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x955849B41A3FC5BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1222554018:1":{"text":"As of now, not yet.","source_cn":"现在——还没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB573AA6953156DCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1222554019:1":{"text":"Since we've chosen to outwit him, with our group and Tasi's dream-altering ability, we'll definitely figure something out.","source_cn":"但既然决定要智取，靠我们几个，再加上塔西塑造梦境的力量...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57F9B54FE19F7162","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1222554020:1":{"text":"Yes, we'll have to brief her on the intel.","source_cn":"嗯……也得把情报告诉她才行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DE9103B6540BDA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1222554021:1":{"text":"Let's go, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>. We need to <style=\"highlight\">return to Tasi and formulate a plan</style>.","source_cn":"走吧，<style=stress><player_na...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0EC529827BA68472","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Let's go, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>. We need to <style=\"highlight\">return to Tasi and formulate a plan</style>.","female":"Let's go, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>. We need to <style=\"highlight\">return to Tasi and formulate a plan</style>.","variant_male_record_index":"138542","variant_female_record_index":"138543","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1222554022:1":{"text":"This time, we must defeat Harak!","source_cn":"这次一定要打败哈拉克！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF2DD1B92AC04BA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:24:0:1":{"text":"Of course.","source_cn":"当然","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3CEA07204D785553","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Of course.","female":"Of course.","variant_male_record_index":"67272","variant_female_record_index":"67273","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:24:1:2":{"text":"I will honor her expectations.","source_cn":"我会回应她的期待","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x95B3845CF7EB42B4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I will honor her expectations.","female":"I will honor her expectations.","variant_male_record_index":"67274","variant_female_record_index":"67275","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:24:2:3":{"text":"If I lose again, I'll lose it.","source_cn":"再输我也要受不了了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA369DE27BA0D98A4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"If I